      "title": "ThreadMode 规则",
      "items": [
        "POSTING 在发布线程直接 invokeSubscriber，零线程切换",
        "MAIN / MAIN_ORDERED 交给 HandlerPoster 回主线程；BACKGROUND / ASYNC 交给线程池 Poster"
      ]
